  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New approaches to a livestock trypanosomiasis vaccine: targeting the bite-site by immunization with novel metacyclicstage
parasite antigens</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research grant to develop new approaches to vaccination against the devastating livestock disease, African animal trypanosomiasis. Vaccination could protect millions of livestock and enhance food security and livelihoods for farmers across sub-Saharan Afr</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
